Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038720,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5038720","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:21Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038720,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5038720","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:21Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038720,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114038479","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Listening to Pilots — A Clearer Cockpit and a Fairer Fight","summary":"Hi pilots! This update started with your comments, so I want to show you how they turned into changes.\"I never knew what the bars meant\"This was the most common feedback. The old bottom panel had four bars and a speed number, and in a fast dogfight nobody looked at it. So I moved everything to where your eyes already are: heat is now the aiming ring, missiles sit around it, and hull and shield ride under your wing. The speed number is gone, because it never helped anyone win a fight.Fewer button","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:33:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038479","verified_at":"2026-10-24T02:45:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114038473","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"update","title":"Big Update: New Combat HUD, Automatic Flares, Roll-Dodge & a Full Balance Pass","summary":"Hi pilots! Thank you for every comment and every run. I read all of it, and this update is built on your feedback.A new combat HUDYour weapon heat is now the aiming ring itself: it fills from the bottom and turns red when you overheat.Missiles sit as notches around the ring, so you never look away from the fight.Hull and shield share one clear icon under your right wing; med kit, missile crate and ability live on the wings.Off-screen markers now circle the crosshair with distinct colors for enem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:31:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038473","verified_at":"2026-10-24T02:45:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114035185","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Flares, Combat Feedback, New UI & a Guided Tutorial","summary":"Thank you for playing the Iron Void demo during Steam Next Fest! Your feedback shaped this update. Here is what's new:Flares and smarter missilesPress F (or D-pad Down) to drop flares. You carry 3 and they slowly recharge.Flares destroy the closest missiles locked on you and pull the rest away.A clear MISSILE INBOUND warning tells you when to use them.Enemy missiles now turn more realistically: out-fly them and they miss.Combat feedbackMulti-kill banners: DOUBLE, TRIPLE, QUAD and RAMPAGE.A combo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:36:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035185","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:55:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114032109","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Iron Void Doubles in Size – 120 Missions & 10 Bosses","summary":"Hi pilots! Steam Next Fest has been amazing, and your feedback pushed us to do something big before launch: we doubled the campaign. Here is a look behind the scenes.120 missions in 10 actsThe campaign grows from 60 to 120 hand-built missions, now organized into ten acts. The story continues after Void Requiem: the silence was never the end – the signal is coming from deeper in the void.Act VI – Afterglow: bomber and turret sieges in the ashes of the last war.Act VII – Hollow Reach: spark swarms","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:34:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032109","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:27:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114032104","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Punchier Combat, New Camera & Clearer HUD","summary":"Thank you again for all the feedback from Steam Next Fest! Here is what's new in the Iron Void demo:Combat feelMuzzle flashes on every gun – yours and your enemies' – so you always see who is firing.Missile smoke trails and launch puffs.Stronger screen shake when you fire, launch missiles, boost and when ships explode near you.Camera & settingsThe camera now sits further back so you can read the fight, with a wider default field of view.New Screen Shake and Camera Distance sliders in the setting","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:33:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032104","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:27:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114028538","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: 12 Missions, First Boss & Evasive Roll","summary":"Thank you for all the feedback during Steam Next Fest! Here's what's new in the demo:More to playThe demo now includes 12 missions – all the way to the first boss, Ironclad.New: Evasive RollHold L2 (or E on keyboard) to barrel-roll out of danger. While you spin, incoming fire can't touch you – but it drains your energy just like boost.Controller layoutDrift moved to R1 so you can drift without letting go of the aim stick.Ability is now on Triangle / Y, missiles on D-pad Up.FixesThe game now star","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028538","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:53:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038720-1847286114027117","game_id":"steam-5038720","kind":"announcement","title":"LIVE: Iron Void Demo Gameplay – Steam Next Fest","summary":"Tune in any time — we're streaming Iron Void: Silent Space demo gameplay around the clock until the end of Steam Next Fest. No commentary, just the silent void.What you'll seeThird-person dogfights against weaving, swarming enemy fightersBullet-hell barrages, a heat-managed cannon and lock-on missilesMissions straight from the demoPlay it yourselfThe demo is playable right now. If you enjoy it, please add Iron Void: Silent Space to your wishlist — it really helps our small indie team!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:14:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027117","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5038720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5038720":"2026-10-26T07:35:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5038720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:58Z"},"5038740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5038720","app_id":5038720,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"13c529c06a7521108dc86f419d54a916f899ad7b129397541907eab2dbdaaca8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"고요한 공허에 맞서는 외로운 전투기. 120개의 수작업 임무에서 탄막 사이를 누비고, 열을 관리하고, 미사일을 잠그고, 10종의 보스를 무너뜨려라. 함선을 벌고, 헌터를 업그레이드하고, 모든 별을 통달하라.","publishers":[{"name":"White Iron Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"White Iron Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793631600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"gameplay trailer 2","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792835359","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5038720/382588664/9197da9bba67d30727b1f5048823a299a1213f58/1792834451/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5038720/382588664/9197da9bba67d30727b1f5048823a299a1213f58/1792834451/microtrai